# Observability

- Logs must be structured JSON and include `requestId` / correlation id
- Never log secrets/PII (mask/omit tokens, passwords, credit cards)
- Provide health endpoints (`/health` liveness; `/ready` readiness when DB/Redis required)
- Consider metrics (Prometheus) and tracing (OpenTelemetry) when scaling
- Use error tracking + alerts (Sentry or similar) for production

